#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=1998-10-23|author=pyth...@my-dejanews.com|title=Re: The Diary of Tinya Wazzo: Entry #66|newsgroup=rec.arts.comics.dc.lsh|url=https://groups.google.com/g/rec.arts.comics.dc.lsh/c/sgSOaHZxNBs/m/pMwpr8J0MIsJ|passage=I haven't seriously '''fanficced''' in years, and I'm aware of what the exercise requires in terms of structure and theme etc.}}
